/* ==========================================================================
   Wind Waker Compass — collectibles.js
   The single registry of every trackable thing in the game. Chapter callouts
   reference these by id, so a checkbox in the walkthrough and the same item
   in a category checklist are always the same underlying state.

   ★ CONTENT RULES — GAMECUBE ORIGINAL (2002/2003), NOT WIND WAKER HD ★
   - Tingle TUNER (GBA link cable item), never the Tingle Bottle.
   - No Swift Sail. Wind's Requiem changes the wind; press A to stop the boat.
   - 8 Triforce Charts, each deciphered by Tingle for 398 rupees (3,184 total).
   - 41 Treasure Charts (61 charts total for 100%).
   - Deluxe Picto Box needs a Forest Firefly; Picto Box holds 3 pictures;
     Carlov carves 1 figurine per day.
   - Savage Labyrinth floor 50 = Piece of Heart (floor 30 = Triforce Chart 6).
   - Withered Korok trees: 20-minute Forest Water timer.

   Counts (dashboard denominators are derived from this file, never hardcoded):
     Heart Pieces 44 · Treasure Charts 41 · Triforce Charts 8 ·
     Special Charts 11 · Figurines 134 · Songs 6 · Great Fairies 8 ·
     Bottles 4 · Item Upgrades 8 · Secret Caves 20 · Submarines 7 ·
     Big Octos 6 · Blue ChuChus 23 · Tingle Statues 5 · Side Quests 16
     NOTE: the project brief says "10" special charts but names 11 —
     all 11 are listed here so nothing gets lost.

   VERIFICATION: heart pieces, side-quest rewards (Hero's Charm = 40 total
   Joy Pendants; cabana = Triforce Chart 2; Skull Necklaces = Treasure Chart
   2), submarines, Great Fairy rewards, and the 23 Blue ChuChu locations were
   checked against the Wind Waker Randomizer's ROM-accurate GameCube item data
   (logic/item_locations.txt + logic/macros.txt) and cross-referenced with
   guides. Still best-effort: a few figurine photo-timing windows (marked
   "verify" inline) and the "details land with its chapter" treasure-chart
   flavor text.
   ========================================================================== */

